INSERT INTO sl_community_posts (id, author_id, body, visibility, media_key, media_type, media_content_type, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
('demo-26-post-01','demo-26-user-01','[DEMO CONTENT] I turned one confusing onboarding screen into three smaller decisions. The useful part was asking what a first-time learner needs to know before they click.','public','','','','published','2026-09-22T09:00:00.000Z','2026-09-22T09:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-02','demo-26-user-02','[DEMO CONTENT] A small database diagram helped me explain an API more clearly than a page of notes. What is the simplest system diagram you have used?','public','','','','published','2026-09-22T11:00:00.000Z','2026-09-22T11:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-03','demo-26-user-03','[DEMO CONTENT] I practised describing a chart without reading every number aloud. The challenge was to make the one decision in the data easier to see.','public','','','','published','2026-09-22T13:00:00.000Z','2026-09-22T13:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-04','demo-26-user-04','[DEMO CONTENT] A ten minute music routine felt more sustainable than a dramatic weekly plan. Small practice still counts when it is easy to return to.','public','','','','published','2026-09-23T09:00:00.000Z','2026-09-23T09:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-05','demo-26-user-05','[DEMO CONTENT] I am collecting examples of visual hierarchy in ordinary places: menus, bus stops, receipts, and signs.','public','','','','published','2026-09-23T11:00:00.000Z','2026-09-23T11:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-06','demo-26-user-06','[DEMO CONTENT] The best meal prep trick in this synthetic example is choosing one base, one vegetable, and one sauce before shopping.','public','','','','published','2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z','2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-07','demo-26-user-07','[DEMO CONTENT] Motion should make a relationship easier to understand, not just make a page feel busy. I am testing that rule on a small card transition.','public','','','','published','2026-09-24T09:00:00.000Z','2026-09-24T09:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-08','demo-26-user-08','[DEMO CONTENT] A habit becomes more believable when the next action takes less than five minutes.','public','','','','published','2026-09-24T11:00:00.000Z','2026-09-24T11:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-09','demo-26-user-02','[DEMO CONTENT] I made a checklist for reviewing an API: name the input, name the failure, name the owner, and name the next observation.','public','','','','published','2026-09-24T13:00:00.000Z','2026-09-24T13:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-10','demo-26-user-03','[DEMO CONTENT] Teaching someone to use a spreadsheet made me notice which words I use without explaining. That was useful feedback for my own notes.','public','','','','published','2026-09-25T09:00:00.000Z','2026-09-25T09:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-11','demo-26-user-05','[DEMO CONTENT] A critique is easier to act on when it names the viewer, the moment, and the intended feeling.','public','','','','published','2026-09-25T11:00:00.000Z','2026-09-25T11:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-post-12','demo-26-user-07','[DEMO CONTENT] My current presentation rule: one moving idea per slide, one pause for the audience, and one concrete next step.','public','','','','published','2026-09-25T13:00:00.000Z','2026-09-25T13:00:00.000Z');
