('demo-26-comment-01','demo-26-post-01','demo-26-user-03','[DEMO] The smaller decisions make the first screen much easier to discuss.','visible','2026-09-22T15:00:00.000Z','2026-09-22T15:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-comment-02','demo-26-post-02','demo-26-user-01','[DEMO] Naming the failure case first is a helpful habit.','visible','2026-09-22T16:00:00.000Z','2026-09-22T16:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-comment-03','demo-26-post-05','demo-26-user-07','[DEMO] Ordinary examples are often better than polished mockups for learning hierarchy.','visible','2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z','2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z'),
('demo-26-comment-04','demo-26-post-08','demo-26-user-04','[DEMO] Five minutes is a useful threshold for returning to a practice.','visible','2026-09-24T15:00:00.000Z','2026-09-24T15:00:00.000Z');
